SUMMARY:Sunset Music Series
DESCRIPTION:We have another amazing line up for The Sunset Music Series this year at The Ranch at Lake Sonoma!!!\nTHIS YEAR GLAMPING AND CAMPING AVAILABLE!!\nBenefits Friends of Lake Sonoma and Wild California \nFree Indoor / Outdoor Concert Inside the Park overlooking the Lake at Lake Sonoma!! \nJune 28 Spikes Sikes and his Awesome hotcakes – Blues and Country Soul \nJuly 26 Soul Fuse – Soul\, Funk\, and R+B \nAug 30 Volker Strifler – Blues Americana \nSept 27 A Case of the Willy’s – featuring 2 time GRAMMY- nominated vocalist Willy Jordan – Soul\, Funk \nOct. 25 Weekend at Bernie’s- Funk\, Rock\, and R+B \nNo outside alcohol\nAll Ages welcome\nWell behaved dogs on leash allowed\nPlease bring your own chair for outdoor seating and sunset viewing \nEvent Link for FREE online tickets and info\nhttps://www.eventbrite.com/e/sunset-music-series-tickets-889914757997?aff=oddtdtcreator \nWebsite for directions and how to rent campsites at the campground\nwww.theranchatlakesonoma.com
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/sunset-music-series-5/
LOCATION:The Ranch at Lake Sonoma\, 100 Marina Road\, Geyserville\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
END:VEVENT
