SUMMARY:First Fridays at Chimera Arts
DESCRIPTION:A showcase of the local maker community – live music\, interactive projects\, demos\, wine and beer\, & more. \nChimera Arts\, Sonoma County’s maker space\, continues their First Fridays at Chimera Arts\, a showcase of our local maker community. There will be live music\, food and beverages\, activities and live demonstrations. \nOld Caz beer\, gourmet hot dogs\, live music and demonstrations\, and hands-on activities. See you there! \nChimera Arts is Sonoma County’s only community arts and makerspace\, located in downtown Sebastopol at the old Ford Garage building. We’re a community of makers that offer classes\, expertise and equipment to anyone interested in bringing their creative ideas to life.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/first-fridays-at-chimera-arts-3/
LOCATION:Chimera Art Space\, 6791 Sebastopol Ave\, Sebastopol\, CA
CATEGORIES:Art,Other
END:VEVENT
